>REM{2009-05-26: JML: ADR#3550: This text was added as part of the Soft Delete feature};

@If(@Environment("HECS_Language") = "E"; "Note: This Order has been marked as Soft Delete:"; "Note: Cette commande à étée supprimée")</formula></code></computedtext></run></par>
